<title>UK: GSI SETS WARRANTS ON SWISS/GERMAN MACHINERY BASKET.</title>
<headline>GSI SETS WARRANTS ON SWISS/GERMAN MACHINERY BASKET.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on a Swiss/German machinery basket, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. Bank said.</p>
<p>The basket includes one bearer share of Georg Fischer AG, two registered share of Saurer, three registered shares of Rieter Holding, two bearer shares of Linde, three bearer shares of Mannesmann and five bearer shares of MAN.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    14500 CHF		 PREMIUM	17.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.50 CHF		  GEARING	9.26 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 21.AUG.97-15.JAN.99   PAYDATE	20.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  13650 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
